{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12225120","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12225120","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1222512001:1":{"text":"おめぇらか。","source_cn":"是你们几个。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC7579DDBB6E11F78","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1222512002:0":{"text":"ボルスさん、今夜こちらのスイートルームに泊ってもいいですか？","source_cn":"波尔斯，我们想再住一晚高级客房。现在可以上去吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6CCF3765251DFFFA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1222512003:1":{"text":"好きにしな。おめぇらがこの街にいる間は、ブラッディ・マリーが毎日部屋代を払ってるからよ。","source_cn":"随意。血薇帮替你们包下了，你们在锈锚港多待一天，他们就...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x29D1E8DA559396D9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1222512004:1":{"text":"これからは、わざわざ俺に言わなくても、好きに入ってかまわないぜ。","source_cn":"以后想住，不用打招呼。直接推门进去就行。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x12296EF7DD439583","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1222512005:1":{"text":"本当ですか？ソニアさん太っ腹！","source_cn":"真的吗？索尼娅好慷慨！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B9A9EF21FC802CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1222512006:1":{"text":"ああ、好きなだけいな！こんなうまい商売、そうそうねえからな！はははっ！","source_cn":"最好多住几天，哈哈！白捡的生意，老子高兴都来不及！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF5DA3512C0D775A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:旅店老板波尔斯":{"text":"宿屋の店主ボルス","source":"旅店老板波尔斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"メイメイ","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"ロンロン","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":7,"localized_text_count":6,"speaker_count":3}}